Package: NICHESv2
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Cell-to-Cell Ligand-Receptor Communication Analysis
Version: 0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nuoya", "Wang",
           email = "nuoya.wang@yale.edu",
           role  = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Micha Sam Brickman", "Raredon",
           role  = "aut"))
Description: Computes ligand-receptor (LR) signalling scores between spatially
    neighbouring cells in single-cell spatial transcriptomics data. Returns a
    NICHESObject (15-slot S3 class) with per-cell aggregation and flexible
    downstream analysis. Supports single-gene and multi-gene complex
    ligands/receptors (underscore-delimited). Built-in loaders for
    ConnectomeDB2025 (default), FANTOM5, and OmniPath LR databases.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/RaredonLab/NICHESv2
